{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Kanokon: Manatsu no Dai Shanikusai","With the arrival of summer and the school break, Chizuru, Kota, and the rest of their friends are lazily enjoying the warm weather. Chizuru flirts with Kota, Kota gets embarrassed, and Nozomu gets in the way. Tayura pines after Akane, Akane rebuffs Tayura, and a sexy good time ensues. The status quo isn't quite the same since the fox snared her prey, but the timeless boy-meets-girl tale lingers on.\n\n\n(Source: Media Blasters)"],"ja":["かのこん ～真夏の大謝肉祭～",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":3503,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-6791","ids":{"shikimori":6791,"mal":6791,"anilist":6791,"kodik":"serial-20556"},"kodikIds":["serial-22328","serial-53297","serial-20556"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-22328":"2020-02-03T23:08:13Z","serial-53297":"2023-08-21T16:47:07Z","serial-20556":"2020-01-01T20:56:22Z"},"title":"Канокон: Большой праздник в разгаре лета","originalTitle":"Kanokon: Manatsu no Daishanikusai","alt":"Kanokon: The Big Midsummer Carnival / OVA Kanokon: Manatsu no daishanikusai - Jou かのこん ～真夏の大謝肉祭～","description":"С приходом лета и школьных каникул Тидзуру , Кота и их друзья лениво наслаждаются тёплой погодкой. Всё как обычно: Тидзуру флиртует с Котой, Кота смущается, а Нодзому им мешает. Таюра чахнет по Аканэ , а та отпирается. Хоть лиса и поймала свою добычу, но бесконечная сказка всё ещё продолжается!","year":2009,"type":"OVA","genres":["Романтика","этти"],"rating":6.52,"popularity":11174,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[3503],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/6791/08dc90e90d1b5c2e994bd9027a8bb79d.jpeg","width":395,"height":560},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/12bfe18d7bc5fc64c001e161a2e93447eabf5090.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":0,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-767","dubId":"767","label":"SHIZA Project","language":"ru","original":false,"